    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Observed behavior\nWhen opening the existing onboarding menu and expanding «Цель» on mobile viewports, `#manifestBody` has a non-zero `scrollHeight` but a 0 px rendered height, so its text is not visible.\n\n## Reproduction evidence\nVerified in Codex In-app Browser using the same route and setup on both the exact parent of PR #427 (`main` at `0d9dd246bb37444bf5073363c4e499393f0b80ff`) and PR #427 head (`3705ffd501056bb828891dd848dfd0fdaf32d8bd`):\n- 390×844: parent height 0 px / scrollHeight 57 px; PR #427 height 0 px / scrollHeight 95 px.\n- 430×932: parent height 0 px / scrollHeight 57 px; PR #427 height 0 px / scrollHeight 76 px.\n\nThe defect predates the Goal copy change and is tracked separately from PR #427. This issue does not authorize broader mobile layout, gameplay, or unrelated interface changes.",
